{"type":"standard","title":"Andrew Garbarino","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Andrew Garbarino</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q21257859","titles":{"canonical":"Andrew_Garbarino","normalized":"Andrew Garbarino","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Andrew Garbarino</span></span>"},"pageid":48014365,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Andrew_Garbarino_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg/330px-Andrew_Garbarino_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/Andrew_Garbarino_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1371260755","tid":"3a0e9e85-a08f-11f1-a8a3-dfeb0b2d35be","timestamp":"2026-08-25T14:14:04Z","description":"American politician (born 1984)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Garbarino","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Garbarino?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Garbarino?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Andrew_Garbarino"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Garbarino","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Andrew_Garbarino","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrew_Garbarino?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Andrew_Garbarino"}},"extract":"Andrew Reed Garbarino is an American attorney and politician serving as the U.S. representative for New York's 2nd congressional district since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, he served as the New York State Assemblyman for the 7th district from 2013 to 2020.","extract_html":"<p><b>Andrew Reed Garbarino</b> is an American attorney and politician serving as the U.S. representative for New York's 2nd congressional district since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, he served as the New York State Assemblyman for the 7th district from 2013 to 2020.</p>"}